  "description": "Strict-OOP, host-agnostic long-term memory library for .NET 8: scoped storage, hybrid (dense + lexical) retrieval with enforced filters, consolidation, graph retrieval, corrective recall, an eval harness, and audit-grade integrity logging — over an own C# vector-index engine (zero third-party vector dependencies; GPU acceleration via ILGPU with transparent CPU fallback included).",
